{
  "about": "NPC pictures (issue #446): `cutin \"Kafra_01\", 2` loads kafra_01.bmp (320x480) with its centre 200 px in from the right edge and its bottom on the screen's; it's a window a drag moves, and the same picture again stays where it is; type 0 puts it 200 px in from the left; type 3 centres it under a title bar with a close button that closes it. The NPC (npc/cutin.txt) is loaded with @loadnpc and unloaded at both ends.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
